      "side": 1,
      "message": "Although this matches a literal reading of the datasheet, it sounds pretty weird. The driver code seems to imply that you need to clear all the edge registers for the interrupt condition to clear, which would be more typical. Maybe ask Aseda what this does in real life. Doesn\u0027t need to change in this CL.",
