      "message": "\u003e I find this to be a weird idiom. The more stuff you add, the more stuff you will need to explicitly reinitialize here that should not change during a device reset.\n\nI don\u0027t see it likely there will be too many fields here that will need to be separately reset; besides the registers mentioned which will end up being structured similarly I think.\n\n\u003e (Out of scope for this review, but the datasheet shows not all of the fields being 0 out of reset.) I was aware of this but I just now realized there is no explicit todo in here for this.\n\nLeaving unresolved for comment.",
